{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Braiding.hecke_mass_trace","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Braiding.hecke_mass_trace","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.Algebra","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.MarkovTrace"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.hecke_mass_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.hecke_mass_trace","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L82-L106","doc":"**Hecke-mass-trace identity** ([`prop:hecke-mass-trace`]).\n\nThe categorical mass coincides with the norm of the Markov trace\nof the Hecke mass element; the trace decomposes additively over\nthe descended + transient pieces. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:hecke-mass-trace","label":"prop:hecke-mass-trace","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hecke-mass-trace.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.claim_trace_decomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.claim_trace_decomposition","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L77-L77","doc":"**Manuscript claim (ii)**: the Markov trace decomposes additively\nover the descended + transient pieces.  The fibre functor `τ` is\nexact and monoidal, so the mass identity descends to `H_n(R, q)`;\n`tr_M` is `R`-linear in its argument.  §3b-cond class field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.claim_cat_mass_eq_norm_trace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.claim_cat_mass_eq_norm_trace","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L71-L71","doc":"**Manuscript claim (i)**: the categorical mass equals the norm of\nthe Markov trace of the Hecke mass element.  Carried as a class\nfield per AGENTS.md §3b-cond — downstream consumers take\n`[HeckeMassTraceContext]` as an explicit hypothesis to obtain this\nidentity without a naked `sorry`; the identity is conditional on\nthe class instance, not an unconditional theorem. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.norm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.norm","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L64-L64","doc":"The `|·| : R → R` absolute-value-like norm. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.cat_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.cat_mass","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L62-L62","doc":"The categorical mass `𝔪(ϱ_β) : R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.Phi_trans","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.Phi_trans","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L60-L60","doc":"The transient components `Φ^trans_i(β) ∈ A` (finite list). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.Phi_desc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.Phi_desc","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The descended component `Φ^desc(β) ∈ A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.Phi_mass","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.Phi_mass","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The Hecke mass element `Φ_mass(β) ∈ A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.markovInst","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.markovInst","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The Markov-trace instance on `A`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.heckeInst","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.heckeInst","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The Hecke-algebra typeclass instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.algebraA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.algebraA","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L50-L50","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.ringA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.ringA","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.A","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The Hecke algebra `A = H_n(R, q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.n","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The strand count `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.q","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L44-L44","doc":"The Hecke parameter `q : R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.invR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.invR","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.ringR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.ringR","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/hecke_mass_trace.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.R","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.HeckeMassTraceContext.R","kind":"def","line"